Ladybird runs the SVG filter of a transformed box in the box’s own
coordinate system, under its transform. Chrome 157, Firefox 151 and
WebKit (Playwright’s 26.5 build) all do, verified at runtime with the
new test. In Blink’s FragmentPaintPropertyTreeBuilder, UpdateFilter()
runs after UpdateTransform() and gives the filter’s effect node the
box’s own transform as its local_transform_space.
